- Approved s1 baseline: `/home/dgilmore/moed/var/backups/test-account-demo-baseline/20261013T002933Z-9522b69c/`. A verified local copy is at `output/test-account/snapshots/20261013T002933Z-9522b69c/`. Read its `README.md`, `receipt.json`, `date-remap-manifest.json`, and `SHA256SUMS.json` before use. Keep this baseline unchanged unless the user explicitly chooses a replacement.
- The source date anchor is `2026-10-12`. Use the then-current date in `America/Chicago` as the destination anchor, with a window from three calendar months before through nine calendar months after. Clamp month ends and leap days; verify coverage of the entire destination window.
